&lt;p&gt;🧪 &lt;strong&gt;Try it live:&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;a href="https://stackblitz.com/edit/react-form-deep-dive-par-2" rel="noopener noreferrer"&gt;Open Demo on StackBlitz&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/blockquote&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Our interactive demo includes a built-in benchmark tool to measure form performance in your environment.&lt;/p&gt;

